# Seal Of Approval

This month our seal of approval goes to the [The Ocean Clean Up](http://www.theoceancleanup.com/), founded by twenty one year old Boyan Slat. This inventor and entrepreneur has found a way of over coming the immense and seemingly impossible task of cleaning our oceans of the millions of tonnes of rubbish accumulating in them. In September 2014 it ran the most successful non-profit crowd funding campaign ever (US$2.2 Million, 38,000 Contributors, 160 countries)! With a feasibility study completed and a mega expedition underway the main project is set to start in 2020. Awesome! Go the largest clean up in history! https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6IjaZ2g-21E
